Recommended changes to apps/api/docs/prototype/swagger.yaml

Generated on 2026-11-24 from the "Recommended changes to ../swagger.yaml"
in claude-exploration/proposed-transfer-api.yaml and section 4 of
claude-exploration/api-scope-and-options.md. Design decisions are from
the user's design session on 2026-11-23, cited as (User 2026-11-23 Qn),
and the follow-up review on 2026-11-24. Apply from the repository root
with: git apply apps/api/docs/prototype/claude-exploration/swagger-recommended-changes.patch

Included:
1. POST /children/{ypid}/stages: stage_type, case_type, schema_version,
   optional supersedes; 422 with a rule ID (GE034, case-type rule, one
   partial Stage per organisation) (Q24, Q28, Q29, Q31).
2. PUT .../stages/{stageid}: an accepted PUT completes the Stage; the
   200 returns StageStatusResponse and no longer the Notification;
   countersignatures and attachment_ids are required (Q7, Q8, Q15, Q43;
   Notification removal: User 2026-11-24).
3. DELETE .../stages/{stageid}: soft cancel of partial Stages, with
   ?reason= and X-Signoff-User, returning the cancelled Stage (Q12-Q14).
4. Wording fixes on DELETE, and on POST, GET, PATCH and PUT.
5. ETag on GET, PATCH and PUT; If-Match required on PATCH and PUT; 412
   (StageOutcome) and 428 (Q2-Q4, Q16, Q18, Q20-Q22). The rebase of a
   stale PATCH with no conflict is still an unconfirmed inference.
6. Idempotency-Key on POST, PATCH and PUT; DELETE intentionally omitted
   (Q22; User 2026-11-24).
7. Stage fields: stageid, status, stage_type, case_type, schema_version,
   supersedes, superseded_by, the two countersignatures, attachment_ids.
8. Stage fields: owner, organisation, created_at, completed_at (no
   proxy_owner).

Excluded by the user on 2026-11-24: schema-version rules (Q30-Q32),
308 for merged ypids (Q26), GET .../stages filters, caretaker 403 wording.

